# procbenchpy UDF benchmark (LANGUAGE hipy) — from
# udf-benchmark/benchmarks/lingodb/procbenchpy-hipy. UDFs use
# `import hipy.lib.sql as sql; sql.execute(...)` which compiles to
# relalg.sql_query and is parsed back into relalg by ParseNestedSQLPass.
# char(N>1) columns are converted to varchar(N) so INSERT VALUES can supply
# non-padded literals. Query bodies are collapsed to single lines to side-
# step sqlite-tester reading them line-by-line.

